Standout Luxury with Poolside Brilliance
94 SPRINGTHORPE BOULEVARD, MACLEOD
Experience the true meaning of an alfresco resort-style lifestyle with this grand-scale family residence showcasing the most exquisite pool and gardens. Offering a layout so generous you can almost lose yourself, the exceptional home is ready to adapt to the needs of your family – and all in a leafy pocket close to amenities.
Situated on a coveted corner and oriented to capture streams of northern sunshine, the expansive home is defined by vast stretches of glass that create an irresistible connection with the lush landscaped gardens. Flowing first past a formal lounge, the unquestionable focal point is the triple-zoned entertaining area that wraps a stunning kitchen with stone benchtops, prestige appliances and a walk-in pantry. Throwing back the oversized stacking doors, seamlessly blends inside with the patio, fully-tiled heated pool & spa along with a fabulous multi-seasonal BBQ area with gorgeous port-hole skylight.
The sleeping quarters are peacefully placed upstairs where they include five fabulous bedrooms including the main suite with two huge walk-in wardrobes and a luxe ensuite. A retreat and versatile rumpus room are also on this level together with a luxe family bathroom and ample built-in storage.
Downstairs comes with a guest powder room and large laundry, while ducted heating/cooling & chic plantation shutters throughout plus not only a double garage but an additional single garage conclude a standout family setting.
Steps to parklands, playgrounds & walking trails, this desirable locale is well serviced by bus routes and merely moments to the station, Latrobe University and shops.


